WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.089 --> 00:00:08.089
There was no time to mourn.

00:00:08.089 --> 00:00:09.089
If we were lucky, we might just get out alive.

00:00:09.089 --> 00:00:13.340
But what waited on the other side would be
possibly my toughest challenge yet.

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:19.900
Hello, and welcome to Al Dente Creepypasta,
horror stories cooked to perfection with a

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:21.349
splash of red sauce.

00:00:21.349 --> 00:00:27.940
My name is CZ and today we’ll be serving
you on the beach, so kick back, relax and

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:33.160
enjoy these vacation horror stories.

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:40.050
Let’s dig right in.

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:41.670
Number One.

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:44.360
Island Adventure.

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:49.070
A woman at the airport had asked me if I was
looking forward to my vacation.

00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:53.120
To simply say yes would have been an understatement.

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:58.960
I had to work overtime for 5 months in order
to afford to get here.

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:05.030
Then I had to find time off from work, and
get off at the same time as my boyfriend.

00:01:05.030 --> 00:01:11.100
We had to research: the perfect resort on
the perfect island with the perfect weather.

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:13.880
But we made it.

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:19.789
Nothing else was between me, the warm tropical
sunshine, a cold refreshing margarita and

00:01:19.789 --> 00:01:25.840
the relaxing sound of waves crashing on the
sand in front me and carelessly rolling back

00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:27.579
into the sea.

00:01:27.579 --> 00:01:33.490
As I dug my toes into the soft sand and laid
back on my beach chair, I thought about all

00:01:33.490 --> 00:01:38.539
possibilities that awaited us here at the
Grand Maritime Beach Resort.

00:01:38.539 --> 00:01:41.259
Kayaking through the ocean breeze.

00:01:41.259 --> 00:01:44.990
Living the high life at the offshore casino.

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:47.979
Backpacking the expansive rainforest by moonlight.

00:01:47.979 --> 00:01:52.709
Or regenerating my body at the luxury poolside
spa.

00:01:52.709 --> 00:01:58.560
Maybe I'd even try SCUBA diving, though I
wasn’t sure I liked the idea of breathing

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:00.399
through a tube.

00:02:00.399 --> 00:02:05.939
I think before any of that though, I'd just
kick back on the beach and enjoy some sunlight.

00:02:05.939 --> 00:02:13.040
We'd had a long trip and it felt good to just
drop our bags, slip into a bikini and take

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:15.120
in the saltwater aroma.

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:19.379
*Yawn* I... could feel myself starting to
fade....

00:02:19.379 --> 00:02:23.159
*Yawn* off too…

00:02:23.159 --> 00:02:24.420
"Lucy.

00:02:24.420 --> 00:02:25.910
Lucy, you OK?"

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:27.829
My boyfriend's touch snapped me out of a daze
after being awoken by that boat horn.

00:02:27.829 --> 00:02:29.930
"Uhh yeah, I just fell asleep.

00:02:29.930 --> 00:02:30.930
What time is it?"

00:02:30.930 --> 00:02:31.930
"About 2.

00:02:31.930 --> 00:02:33.380
You were tired.

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:34.850
You look dead."

00:02:34.850 --> 00:02:35.850
"Thanks..."

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:37.549
"I was just going up to the bar.

00:02:37.549 --> 00:02:38.569
Do you want anything to drink?"

00:02:38.569 --> 00:02:42.040
"You could grab me a Piña Colada I guess."

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:43.040
"OK."

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:45.650
He kissed me and headed off to the bar.

00:02:45.650 --> 00:02:51.610
Before I could doze off again a strange little
man came walking down the beach with a clipboard.

00:02:51.610 --> 00:02:55.880
He looked like one of the locals, a bit of
an oddball one at that.

00:02:55.880 --> 00:03:00.489
He went from chair to chair, making his way
up to where I was.

00:03:00.489 --> 00:03:05.450
When he arrived, he asked if I was interested
in going on an 'island adventure'.

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:10.840
He explained that it would include backpacking
in the rainforest, ziplining, roasting food

00:03:10.840 --> 00:03:15.280
by a campfire and bathing in a private waterfall
grotto.

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:21.170
The clipboard included photos of what looked
like an absolutely amazing time to me, so

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:26.620
I told him it looked perfect and I wanted
to sign my boyfriend and I up for it.

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:32.189
He told me to follow him down the beach to
the activity shack so I could make a reservation.

00:03:32.189 --> 00:03:36.079
I dipped my feet in the water as we strolled
the length of the shore, but the man kept

00:03:36.079 --> 00:03:37.620
rushing me along.

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:42.060
I didn't think much of it at the time, just
assuming he was impatient.

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:46.700
That should have been my first of many red
flags.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:49.650
Next we walked off the property of the resort.

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:53.430
I asked if the expedition was included in
the resort package.

00:03:53.430 --> 00:03:58.249
He told me it was, and I had no reason to
believe otherwise.

00:03:58.249 --> 00:04:00.829
We finally get down to the little hut.

00:04:00.829 --> 00:04:06.180
All I remember was it being completely empty
and not really looking like an activity shack

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:07.889
at all.

00:04:07.889 --> 00:04:13.049
The guy quickly apologized and told me that
the activity director must have already headed

00:04:13.049 --> 00:04:16.470
up to the site to begin preparing for the
excursion.

00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:20.870
I was starting to get pretty annoyed at this
point and told him I better walk back and

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:26.039
let my boyfriend know, but he assured me that
the site was just across the street and it

00:04:26.039 --> 00:04:28.860
would only be a couple more minutes.

00:04:28.860 --> 00:04:33.039
I was reluctant but didn't want to be rude,
since he insisted.

00:04:33.039 --> 00:04:38.889
Besides, it would be good for me to get to
scope out where we would be exploring.

00:04:38.889 --> 00:04:40.870
So we made our way inland.

00:04:40.870 --> 00:04:43.580
I had to run across the street barefoot.

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:45.250
No crosswalk.

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:50.669
This led us directly into the rainforest and
when we got there, I started to get a bad

00:04:50.669 --> 00:04:51.669
feeling.

00:04:51.669 --> 00:04:57.310
There was no set path we were following, we
was just leading me deeper into the forest.

00:04:57.310 --> 00:05:03.020
The other thing that set me off at this point
was the complete lack of other tourists.

00:05:03.020 --> 00:05:08.590
I thought for sure we'd see other couples
signing up as well, but... scratch that, it

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:13.750
wasn't just a lack of other tourists, it was
a lack of of people.

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:16.620
There was nobody out here.

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:21.160
Just me and this guy who randomly approached
me on the beach.

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:25.340
I had no real idea that he actually worked
for the resort.

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:30.920
He was kind of scraggy and unkempt, certainly
not up to the standards of grooming we had

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:32.590
seen at the front desk.

00:05:32.590 --> 00:05:38.430
But he did look to be an island local, like
most of the employees we had seen at the resort.

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:42.930
And it's not like the island adventure expedition
wasn't advertised in the brochures.

00:05:42.930 --> 00:05:48.430
But something deep inside me said that this
wasn't the real thing.

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:50.370
I got more and more nervous.

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:55.090
I was honestly thinking about turning and
running, but the only thing that stopped me

00:05:55.090 --> 00:06:00.550
from doing it was how embarrassing it would
be if this was legit, because there was still

00:06:00.550 --> 00:06:02.500
some doubt in my mind.

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:09.130
Besides, it's not like I'd make it very far
with no shoes and no idea where I was going.

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:14.550
I debated doing it anyway in my head when
something emerged in the distance.

00:06:14.550 --> 00:06:19.250
Another man was standing out there, veiled
by a layer of fog and facing slightly away

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:21.320
from us.

00:06:21.320 --> 00:06:26.220
Relief washed over me when the guy I was with
called out to him in another language and

00:06:26.220 --> 00:06:28.319
the guy came up to us.

00:06:28.319 --> 00:06:33.020
Realistically, it was just a couple minutes,
just as he had told me back at the activity

00:06:33.020 --> 00:06:34.500
shack.

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:38.629
Before I could feel silly for doubting him,
the two men went back and forth in their native

00:06:38.629 --> 00:06:39.710
tongue.

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:45.050
I don't know what they were saying obviously,
but I just know they were talking very quickly.

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:52.620
But, what was weird was this new guy was staring
at me, not making eye contact with the other

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:53.620
man.

00:06:53.620 --> 00:07:00.129
Actually, he wasn't just staring at me, he
was eyeing my body... up and down.

00:07:00.129 --> 00:07:05.680
I felt exposed and uncomfortable, but let's
face it, it wasn't the first time a guy couldn't

00:07:05.680 --> 00:07:07.080
keep his eyes off.

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:12.000
It's just that usually they try a little bit
to hide it.

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:15.729
He continued to fire off questions I couldn't
understand.

00:07:15.729 --> 00:07:18.659
I looked up at the rainforest we'd be exploring.

00:07:18.659 --> 00:07:21.330
It wasn't exactly as I’d pictured it.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:23.000
How far was the zipline?

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.770
Where was the waterfall?

00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:29.470
That's when... both of them went quiet.

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:30.949
I looked back down at them.

00:07:30.949 --> 00:07:34.470
Both of them were staring at me.

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:40.470
I smiled sheepishly, then the two men simultaneously
grabbed me!

00:07:40.470 --> 00:07:46.560
I tried to scream, but one of their hands
reached over muffled my mouth as both of them

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:48.919
dragged me down to the ground!

00:07:48.919 --> 00:07:54.729
I was completely helpless to resist with the
full weight of two bodies crushing me.

00:07:54.729 --> 00:08:02.099
A hand pinched my nose and closed my nostrils;
tears began to flow but I couldn’t breathe!

00:08:02.099 --> 00:08:04.719
I was completely powerless.

00:08:04.719 --> 00:08:07.449
There was nothing I could do.

00:08:07.449 --> 00:08:11.770
The black started to envelop me from the corners
of my vision.

00:08:11.770 --> 00:08:18.169
Just before I blacked out, I saw something
in a blur through my tears, deep in the distance.

00:08:18.169 --> 00:08:22.000
There was a third person way back in the trees.

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:29.139
It was the last thing I saw before the black
crashed in and I was out.

00:08:29.139 --> 00:08:32.620
For the second time that day, I awoke in a
haze.

00:08:32.620 --> 00:08:34.640
I thought I never would.

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:37.340
But I was alive.

00:08:37.340 --> 00:08:38.370
It was getting dark out.

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:41.020
But we were still in the forest.

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:43.160
A different part of the forest.

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:45.280
I didn’t know how deep in we were.

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:47.770
I actually couldn’t make out much.

00:08:47.770 --> 00:08:49.790
My vision was a blur.

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:52.530
It was like looking through beer goggles.

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:57.700
My right arm felt dead, almost impossible
to lift, but with some effort I could move

00:08:57.700 --> 00:09:02.730
it around and shoo off some of the hundreds
of bugs flying right over my body.

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:06.780
It didn’t do much good, they were everywhere.

00:09:06.780 --> 00:09:10.030
The two men were sitting by a campfire talking.

00:09:10.030 --> 00:09:12.720
Clearly they hadn’t noticed me wake up.

00:09:12.720 --> 00:09:15.840
From what I could tell, they were about 10
meters away.

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:18.560
There was also a Jeep parked nearby now too.

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:22.260
I felt as if I was hungover and drunk at the
same time.

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:27.480
But this was my only chance to try to escape
and I knew it.

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:30.120
There were just a few problems.

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:36.390
I had no idea where I was, how far we were
from the beach, or from any civilization for

00:09:36.390 --> 00:09:37.710
that matter.

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:40.270
I was not in much condition to run.

00:09:40.270 --> 00:09:45.040
I still had no shoes, and my bikini was not
great for running in to begin with.

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:47.960
Normally I might be more confident.

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:53.680
I do jog for 45 minutes almost every day,
so I had pretty good endurance.

00:09:53.680 --> 00:09:57.520
I don’t know what these two men were capable
of though.

00:09:57.520 --> 00:10:01.690
And then there was that third guy I had seen
in the distance.

00:10:01.690 --> 00:10:02.950
Where was he?

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:04.790
Was he one of them?

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:08.090
Was he going to be patrolling the perimeter?

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:12.580
Before I could think of a plan, I saw them
turn their back to me and go the car.

00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:15.000
This was my chance.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.590
I wobbled to feet.

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:21.010
I didn’t break into a full sprint right
away, trying to strike a balance between speed

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.820
and stealth.

00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:28.980
As I got further from the campfire, it got
very dark, even just a few meters ahead of

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:31.120
me was starting to look pitch black.

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:33.590
It wasn’t long before…

00:10:33.590 --> 00:10:36.010
I stepped on something hard and rough.

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:39.870
It rolled me off my feet and I went crashing
to the ground.

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:41.090
Shoot.

00:10:41.090 --> 00:10:45.450
I heard their yelling out in the distance
as they realized I was gone.

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:49.650
I pulled myself to feet, feeling even woozier
than before.

00:10:49.650 --> 00:10:52.490
I heard the Jeep start somewhere in the background.

00:10:52.490 --> 00:10:58.500
The headlights flared up behind me so I scrambled
my way to the nearest bump in the terrain

00:10:58.500 --> 00:11:01.823
and ducked out behind it, doing my best not
to move a muscle.

00:11:01.823 --> 00:11:07.980
The area lit up as the vehicle turned around
and headed in my direction.

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:13.310
It pretty much mowed over the low-lying vegetation
as it tore over the bumpy terrain and headed

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:15.590
straight for me.

00:11:15.590 --> 00:11:19.230
They… they didn’t see me.

00:11:19.230 --> 00:11:22.830
The jeep passed and I was safe for a little
while longer.

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:27.810
I figured I’d have to develop a strategy
so I could continue in one direction, as not

00:11:27.810 --> 00:11:30.240
to send myself in circles.

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:34.120
I decided to go perpendicular to the way they
had just driven.

00:11:34.120 --> 00:11:39.560
That way if they try to comb the area it will
take them a long time to get to me.

00:11:39.560 --> 00:11:41.350
I got to me feet and set off.

00:11:41.350 --> 00:11:45.340
But then I heard something that stopped me
in my tracks.

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:48.610
It wasn’t loud.

00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:53.670
I wasn’t even entirely sure I had heard
it all.

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:56.760
Until I heard it again.

00:11:56.760 --> 00:11:58.580
There were footsteps.

00:11:58.580 --> 00:12:00.870
Probably a good 30 meters or so.

00:12:00.870 --> 00:12:05.610
My head was still spinning and I couldn’t
exactly tell which direction they were coming

00:12:05.610 --> 00:12:06.610
from.

00:12:06.610 --> 00:12:09.500
Once again I had to reassess my situation.

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:11.080
I looked around.

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:15.850
Absolutely no light, other than the faint
moon’s glow.

00:12:15.850 --> 00:12:18.980
I couldn’t make out where the footsteps
were coming from.

00:12:18.980 --> 00:12:21.360
Or who they were coming from.

00:12:21.360 --> 00:12:24.730
What if only one of them had gotten in the
car?

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:28.890
Or could this be that third person I had seen
in the distance?

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:31.640
It could be a random person for all I knew.

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:34.230
It might be worth calling out for help.

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:37.480
But if it was one of them…

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:39.570
I didn’t have time to sit and think about
it.

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:41.870
The footsteps were getting louder.

00:12:41.870 --> 00:12:44.440
I decided to try and quietly move away.

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:47.450
It was getting harder to get around though.

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:52.120
Not only was it dark but my vision was swirling
more and more.

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:57.050
It seemed like the more ground I covered,
the louder the other footsteps got.

00:12:57.050 --> 00:13:02.440
The anxiety, the swirling headache, the sick
feeling I had…

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:04.870
all of it was getting to me.

00:13:04.870 --> 00:13:08.380
Before I knew what had happened, I collapsed.

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:11.580
I laid on the ground breathing heavily.

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:16.730
The last thing I saw this time was a pair
of boots on the ground in front of me.

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:20.010
They walked up and stopped just before my
face.

00:13:20.010 --> 00:13:22.440
I couldn’t go on.

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:29.040
I felt myself start to fade once again…

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:30.310
Number Two.

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:32.780
International Waters.

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:35.200
“Molly, come on!

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:36.880
They’re leaving!”

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:40.130
I called back to my wife as she waddled down
the dock in her high heels.

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:42.010
*sigh* What’s the point?

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:43.980
I thought to myself.

00:13:43.980 --> 00:13:45.600
We were going to miss it.

00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:47.930
It was already three minutes past two.

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:50.100
The boat should have left by now.

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:55.220
Sure enough, just as we reached the end of
the dock, the ship pulled away and headed

00:13:55.220 --> 00:13:56.220
out to sea.

00:13:56.220 --> 00:13:59.490
If only she hadn’t taken so long to get
ready…

00:13:59.490 --> 00:14:00.490
“Oh, no!!

00:14:00.490 --> 00:14:01.490
Shoot!

00:14:01.490 --> 00:14:02.490
I’m sorry Tom.

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:03.960
Agh, we just missed it too!”

00:14:03.960 --> 00:14:04.960
“Come on.

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:09.600
At least we can still enjoy the poolside bar
for a few more hours while the sun’s still

00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:10.600
up.”

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:12.680
I turned back towards the mainland.

00:14:12.680 --> 00:14:14.810
Then I heard a voice behind me.

00:14:14.810 --> 00:14:18.370
It came from one of the island locals who
was sitting at the end of the pier.

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:22.740
Apparently there was going to be be a smaller
shuttle boat that would take people out to

00:14:22.740 --> 00:14:25.070
the casino boat in about an hour.

00:14:25.070 --> 00:14:26.070
Perfect for us.

00:14:26.070 --> 00:14:29.640
I made sure next time we were waiting out
there 15 minutes early.

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:34.970
Right at 3:00PM, the same guy from the dock
earlier pulled up in a tiny speedboat.

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:39.390
He helped us aboard, then, once we were seated,
he fired up the engine.

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:44.280
I asked him if we were going to wait for any
other guests, but he told us we were the only

00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:47.560
ones, so just like that, we took off.

00:14:47.560 --> 00:14:51.540
The sea breeze whipped through our hair as
the island behind us got smaller and smaller

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:53.040
in the distance.

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:57.130
Molly grabbed onto me for safety as we looked
on at the sparkling horizon.

00:14:57.130 --> 00:15:03.530
Eventually, a speck appeared on that horizon,
and not long after, that speck became a boat;

00:15:03.530 --> 00:15:07.100
the boat upon which we would be spending the
rest of our evening.

00:15:07.100 --> 00:15:09.720
When we walked in, the place was popping.

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:14.130
Blackjack tables, poker, craps, roulette,
a disco ball bumping to beat of the bass and

00:15:14.130 --> 00:15:17.530
bottle girls for every table, couch and lounge
chair.

00:15:17.530 --> 00:15:20.410
It looked like there was more in the rooms
beyond as well.

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:23.970
We spent probably the first four hours or
so in this initial room.

00:15:23.970 --> 00:15:28.510
I wasn’t really keeping track of time, but
that was more of an estimate based of the

00:15:28.510 --> 00:15:30.840
amount of drinks my wife and I downed.

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:35.150
We jumped around from game to game, spending
some of the time together and some apart.

00:15:35.150 --> 00:15:39.630
I wanted to give one more spin at the roulette
table, and I wasn’t sure where exactly my

00:15:39.630 --> 00:15:40.630
wife had run off to.

00:15:40.630 --> 00:15:45.180
I was getting kind of low on chips and wondered
if she was doing any better.

00:15:45.180 --> 00:15:50.020
I noticed the guy next to me had a huge stack
of chips, the most I had seen anyone with

00:15:50.020 --> 00:15:51.470
the entire night.

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:56.310
I inquired about where he had all the good
luck and he told me he made almost all of

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:59.200
his earnings in... “the private rooms.”

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:03.680
He went on to explain that the casino operates
off shore because what goes on in the private

00:16:03.680 --> 00:16:05.000
rooms is very illegal.

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:07.260
But not in international waters.

00:16:07.260 --> 00:16:09.190
I asked if he had any tips.

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:13.590
He told me to stay calm, be logical and don’t
do anything rash.

00:16:13.590 --> 00:16:18.270
He said you can make a lot of money there,
but you have to know when to sit back and

00:16:18.270 --> 00:16:22.650
observe and when it’s a good time to punch
it and buy in high.

00:16:22.650 --> 00:16:27.240
And the last thing he told me was that this
room was not for the light hearted, or the

00:16:27.240 --> 00:16:28.410
morally righteous.

00:16:28.410 --> 00:16:30.870
I went to go find Molly.

00:16:30.870 --> 00:16:35.260
The first area beyond the curtained door was
just a little waiting area with a bouncer.

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:39.660
He asked us if we wanted to play in a private
room and made sure we knew that we’d have

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:44.440
to stay for the duration of the game, so if
we needed to use the restroom, to do it now.

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:48.550
He reiterated what that one guy had told me
about this being a moral ground zero.

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:50.060
Then we waited.

00:16:50.060 --> 00:16:55.010
I hadn’t noticed anyone come out of the
room, but after we’d waited about 20 minutes,

00:16:55.010 --> 00:16:59.770
the door opened and we found two chairs in
front of a bank teller window type of thing

00:16:59.770 --> 00:17:03.760
with a little slot, presumably to exchange
our chips.

00:17:03.760 --> 00:17:08.189
Beyond the window was a bigger room with several
vertical wall panels made up of grey metal

00:17:08.189 --> 00:17:09.189
sheets.

00:17:09.189 --> 00:17:13.860
There was a door in the corner of the room
and a large mirror on each wall.

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:18.819
A bright, disc-shaped light on the ceiling
was the only means of illumination.

00:17:18.819 --> 00:17:20.850
Someone stepped into the room with us.

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:23.429
It was one of their bottle girls.

00:17:23.429 --> 00:17:27.139
She poured each of us a glass and explained
that tonight’s game would come in three

00:17:27.139 --> 00:17:28.319
parts.

00:17:28.319 --> 00:17:34.240
Minimum bet would be 15 credits and we would
be required to place a bet for each game.

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:39.110
The first game would require us to bet on
who could hang in the longest.

00:17:39.110 --> 00:17:43.159
Suddenly I felt kind of a nasty feeling as
I thought about all the warnings of moral

00:17:43.159 --> 00:17:44.279
values.

00:17:44.279 --> 00:17:48.250
When it was described to me I imagined something
along the lines of the board game Sorry!

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:50.929
where you had to bump off the other players
to win.

00:17:50.929 --> 00:17:56.329
I hadn’t even anticipated the possibility
of a survival game… soooo you can imagine

00:17:56.329 --> 00:18:00.740
my relief when they wheeled five horizontal
bars into the room beyond our window.

00:18:00.740 --> 00:18:02.960
I guess my wife had gotten the same idea.

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:07.840
“When they said ‘who can hang in the longest,’
what came to your mind?”

00:18:07.840 --> 00:18:09.080
“Uh… haha.

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:12.490
I guess I thought we were sponsoring the Hunger
Games for a second there.”

00:18:12.490 --> 00:18:18.259
That’s when they marched five women, completely
naked, out onto the floor.

00:18:18.259 --> 00:18:24.059
My wife glared at me; I told her I honestly
had no idea, but she crossed her arms.

00:18:24.059 --> 00:18:26.909
Each of the women took their place under the
bars.

00:18:26.909 --> 00:18:32.009
My immediate thought when I saw them was that
they-- looked tired and disheveled, they certainly

00:18:32.009 --> 00:18:33.860
didn’t seem happy to be there.

00:18:33.860 --> 00:18:37.630
But given what I thought the circumstances
were a minute ago, it didn’t bother me as

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:38.980
much as it should have.

00:18:38.980 --> 00:18:43.179
“So we just have to pick to which one can
hang on the bar the longest?

00:18:43.179 --> 00:18:44.200
Seems easy.

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:46.639
The lightest one should have the advantage.

00:18:46.639 --> 00:18:47.639
Second from the right.”

00:18:47.639 --> 00:18:49.129
“Yeah but what about grip strength?”

00:18:49.129 --> 00:18:51.870
“How would we know what their grip strength
is like?”

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:52.870
“I don’t know.

00:18:52.870 --> 00:18:54.220
Maybe the one on the left?

00:18:54.220 --> 00:18:55.509
Maybe the one next to her?”

00:18:55.509 --> 00:18:57.120
“This feels so wrong.

00:18:57.120 --> 00:19:00.000
It’s like we’re slave traders up here
or something.”

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:04.850
I could tell that she was half joking, but
a small part of me did feel that it was wrong,

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:08.450
sitting up here judging these exposed women
based on their bodies.

00:19:08.450 --> 00:19:11.690
Our drinks were refilled and we were given
a little card.

00:19:11.690 --> 00:19:16.809
Without going into too much detail, the card
contained odds and buy-in price for each candidate.

00:19:16.809 --> 00:19:20.940
Our skinny candidate had the best odds, but
that also meant she had the biggest buy-in

00:19:20.940 --> 00:19:22.149
price.

00:19:22.149 --> 00:19:25.899
So the system that they had here was kind
of the inverse of what you might expect from

00:19:25.899 --> 00:19:28.100
a horse track or something similar.

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:30.990
We still decided to go for the small chick
anyways.

00:19:30.990 --> 00:19:35.080
I could feel the drinks starting to get to
me as I counted out the necessary amount of

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:38.039
chips to put in the slot in order to bet on
her.

00:19:38.039 --> 00:19:42.980
Once the bets were in, one more of the casino
employees went down into the room and dumped

00:19:42.980 --> 00:19:45.529
a bucket of water on the floor.

00:19:45.529 --> 00:19:50.830
The water spread evenly throughout the room,
creating a shallow pool all the way around.

00:19:50.830 --> 00:19:52.550
“What is that for?”

00:19:52.550 --> 00:19:53.840
“I don’t know.

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:56.879
Maybe it’s to make it obvious if someone
touches the ground?”

00:19:56.879 --> 00:20:01.110
To be honest, I really had no idea, but soon
I would find out.

00:20:01.110 --> 00:20:05.720
The competition began and all five ladies
jumped up onto the bar.

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:09.440
One of them immediately lost their handle
came crashing down to the ground.

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:12.350
Her scream was cut short by an electric buzz!

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:14.740
She was flailing and freaking out on the ground.

00:20:14.740 --> 00:20:16.840
“Oh my God…”

00:20:16.840 --> 00:20:20.429
That’s when I realized the true intent of
the groundwater…

00:20:20.429 --> 00:20:22.899
It wasn’t to show who had touched the ground…

00:20:22.899 --> 00:20:24.190
I mean, maybe it was.

00:20:24.190 --> 00:20:27.840
But the main purpose was a motivation to stay
on the bar.

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:31.850
There was some kind of an electric current
running through the water, probably not enough

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:34.769
to kill, but definitely enough to pack a punch.

00:20:34.769 --> 00:20:38.529
The poor lady was screeching and desperately
trying to get back on the bar, but she just

00:20:38.529 --> 00:20:40.460
didn’t have what it takes it to hold on.

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:46.380
She kept falling, and getting shocked, then
trying to pull back up and falling again.

00:20:46.380 --> 00:20:49.399
It was… hard to watch.

00:20:49.399 --> 00:20:53.779
After about 20 seconds, the girl next to her
went down, and it looked like the surge that

00:20:53.779 --> 00:20:56.179
went through her was even more violent.

00:20:56.179 --> 00:21:01.539
She however, was able to get back up on the
bar and wrap her legs around it in order to

00:21:01.539 --> 00:21:03.320
avoid further pain.

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:06.460
The first woman just wasn’t able to pull
herself up though.

00:21:06.460 --> 00:21:10.179
Molly was having difficulty stomaching what
she was seeing.

00:21:10.179 --> 00:21:12.919
She grabbed my hand and gave me a helpless
look of concern.

00:21:12.919 --> 00:21:14.970
“Let’s get out of here.”

00:21:14.970 --> 00:21:17.330
We headed for the exit, but the door was locked.

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:18.330
“Hey!

00:21:18.330 --> 00:21:19.330
We’re done!

00:21:19.330 --> 00:21:20.870
Let us out!”

00:21:20.870 --> 00:21:24.529
But we were reminded that we had to agreed
to stay for the entire game.

00:21:24.529 --> 00:21:29.419
And I realized that, not only would we have
to sit there, but we’d also have to place

00:21:29.419 --> 00:21:34.880
bets and continue to support the degrading,
inhumane experiences that were going on down

00:21:34.880 --> 00:21:35.880
there.

00:21:35.880 --> 00:21:37.880
What had I gotten us into?

00:21:37.880 --> 00:21:41.710
Another girl fell and got a short jolt of
electricity before hopping up and wrapping

00:21:41.710 --> 00:21:44.059
her legs around the bar for safety.

00:21:44.059 --> 00:21:49.309
It came down to two final girls, our girl
and the more muscular looking girl I had suggested

00:21:49.309 --> 00:21:50.309
earlier.

00:21:50.309 --> 00:21:53.879
Our girl started to lose her grip and shifted
around to regain her position.

00:21:53.879 --> 00:21:58.010
But a couple seconds later she was wobbling
again.

00:21:58.010 --> 00:22:02.820
She cried out and actually burst into tears
while still holding onto the bar.

00:22:02.820 --> 00:22:07.400
I guess she already knew she was going to
lose but continued to hold out as long as

00:22:07.400 --> 00:22:08.759
possible.

00:22:08.759 --> 00:22:14.220
Before long she slipped, and I could actually
hear her yell out, ‘NO!’ as she did so.

00:22:14.220 --> 00:22:19.220
Luckily, she only got a few seconds of voltage,
the currents seemed to turn off, and the last

00:22:19.220 --> 00:22:22.009
woman let herself down from the bar in safety.

00:22:22.009 --> 00:22:25.600
The whole thing was maybe only a minute and
half, but the first to have fallen was in

00:22:25.600 --> 00:22:27.210
pain for all of it.

00:22:27.210 --> 00:22:30.809
She was alive but she didn’t get up right
away.

00:22:30.809 --> 00:22:35.059
Her hair was literally standing up in all
directions and her skin was charred like something

00:22:35.059 --> 00:22:36.610
out of a cartoon.

00:22:36.610 --> 00:22:39.249
It was just disgusting to watch.

00:22:39.249 --> 00:22:43.210
Barbaric, but that’s probably not a strong
enough word to describe the pain she must

00:22:43.210 --> 00:22:44.690
have been in…

00:22:44.690 --> 00:22:49.290
Eventually the room was cleared and a water
vacuum was used to dry things up as the bars

00:22:49.290 --> 00:22:52.870
were taken out in preparation of the next
game.

00:22:52.870 --> 00:22:58.630
They ended up bringing out these big wide
yellow rulers, four feet in length and placing

00:22:58.630 --> 00:23:00.240
them against the wall.

00:23:00.240 --> 00:23:04.370
When they brought the women back out, they
had on nothing but these knee-high boots,

00:23:04.370 --> 00:23:09.570
which subsequently latched into the wall at
the knee and at the toe, so their shins were

00:23:09.570 --> 00:23:12.899
pretty much locked in, parallel to the wall.

00:23:12.899 --> 00:23:19.659
As our drinks were refilled, we were given
another card, simply labeled “flexibility”.

00:23:19.659 --> 00:23:23.450
Like before, it gave us odds and buy-in price
for each of the contestants.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:27.970
I noticed that some of the contestants were
the same, but some had been swapped out.

00:23:27.970 --> 00:23:31.179
The final two girls from the last game were
still there.

00:23:31.179 --> 00:23:33.509
We again contemplated not betting.

00:23:33.509 --> 00:23:37.499
We stalled for a few minutes, hoping they
would just start the game without our bet.

00:23:37.499 --> 00:23:41.559
The bottle girl came back in and old us there
had been a change and exchanged the card we

00:23:41.559 --> 00:23:43.169
had for another card.

00:23:43.169 --> 00:23:45.779
The only difference was they added one more
contestant.

00:23:45.779 --> 00:23:50.160
Again, we tried to wait it out without betting
and we were interrupted by a bouncer who burst

00:23:50.160 --> 00:23:53.460
into our room and told us to hurry up and
make a bet.

00:23:53.460 --> 00:23:58.700
We tried to explain that we were no longer
comfortable with it, but it didn’t help.

00:23:58.700 --> 00:24:03.009
I quickly realized our best option was to
just finish the game and not come back.

00:24:03.009 --> 00:24:06.880
We soon realized there were only two contestants
out of the six that we could even afford with

00:24:06.880 --> 00:24:11.279
the chips that we had left, and they were
the bottom two in terms of odds.

00:24:11.279 --> 00:24:16.549
We went with the cheapest one, wanting to
support this heinous game as little as possible.

00:24:16.549 --> 00:24:21.279
The game started and the object was to bend
back as far as possible in a bridge position.

00:24:21.279 --> 00:24:25.520
Their score was measured by how close they
could get their hands to their heels.

00:24:25.520 --> 00:24:30.070
It didn’t seem like this game would be anywhere
near as brutal as the last one, but I was

00:24:30.070 --> 00:24:32.830
unfortunately surprised to see how close it
came.

00:24:32.830 --> 00:24:35.940
I saw contortions that I didn’t even think
were possible.

00:24:35.940 --> 00:24:39.669
All of the contestants were able to see each
other, and each of them seemed to be trying

00:24:39.669 --> 00:24:41.110
their hardest.

00:24:41.110 --> 00:24:46.409
If there was some kind of external motivator
in this game like there was in the last, I

00:24:46.409 --> 00:24:50.769
couldn’t see what it was, but I could tell
none of them wanted to lose.

00:24:50.769 --> 00:24:55.629
It got to the point of one girl pushing herself
so hard that she screamed out and collapsed

00:24:55.629 --> 00:24:59.070
on the floor when she wasn’t able to go
any further.

00:24:59.070 --> 00:25:03.771
As they continued to strain, there were two
clear leaders: the petite girl and the more

00:25:03.771 --> 00:25:07.470
buff looking one who were the final two of
the previous round.

00:25:07.470 --> 00:25:11.850
This time the smaller girl came out on top,
and her rival slammed her hand on the floor

00:25:11.850 --> 00:25:12.850
in frustration.

00:25:12.850 --> 00:25:17.019
Round two was over, only one to go.

00:25:17.019 --> 00:25:20.730
The ladies were pushed to the breaking point,
but I was just glad that we got through that

00:25:20.730 --> 00:25:23.840
one with nobody’s back being broken.

00:25:23.840 --> 00:25:28.119
It wasn’t even the worst thing in the world,
and I was hoping that the final round would

00:25:28.119 --> 00:25:33.020
also be more tame and we could get out of
there with somewhat of a lighter conscience.

00:25:33.020 --> 00:25:38.100
Hopefully we’d be able to suppress this
night and enjoy the rest of our vacation after

00:25:38.100 --> 00:25:39.100
this.

00:25:39.100 --> 00:25:42.970
That all went out the window with what happened
next though.

00:25:42.970 --> 00:25:48.970
Five men came into the room, each carrying
a long nosed rifle gun, but before you ask,

00:25:48.970 --> 00:25:53.499
no, nobody was shot during this game, but
I didn’t know that at the time.

00:25:53.499 --> 00:25:57.700
That’s not to say what actually ended up
going down wasn’t horrifying though.

00:25:57.700 --> 00:26:01.700
The barrel of each each of these guns was
painted with a series of rainbow colored stripes

00:26:01.700 --> 00:26:04.350
stretching from the tip of the gun inwards.

00:26:04.350 --> 00:26:08.639
I didn’t understand what the meaning of
any of this was, until the bottle girl came

00:26:08.639 --> 00:26:11.059
in and gave us the final card.

00:26:11.059 --> 00:26:14.309
Printed upon it was the name of this last
game: Penetration.

00:26:14.309 --> 00:26:20.429
I looked at it in disbelief, but before I
could even begin to protest, Molly pointed

00:26:20.429 --> 00:26:24.899
out that with the chips we had left, we couldn’t
even afford the cheapest buy-in.

00:26:24.899 --> 00:26:28.309
Maybe this would finally prompt them kicking
us out.

00:26:28.309 --> 00:26:31.669
We were more than ready to be done with this.

00:26:31.669 --> 00:26:36.440
But after we once again failed to place a
bet, the bouncer came in to see what was up.

00:26:36.440 --> 00:26:40.580
We explained our situation and he told us
we’d have to get some more chips and told

00:26:40.580 --> 00:26:42.740
my wife to come with him.

00:26:42.740 --> 00:26:46.200
Minutes later he came back with a velvet bag
and handed it to me.

00:26:46.200 --> 00:26:48.100
It was filled with tons of chips!

00:26:48.100 --> 00:26:50.749
Way more than we ever had before.

00:26:50.749 --> 00:26:52.090
More than that guy at the roulette table.

00:26:52.090 --> 00:26:54.159
More than we could probably afford.

00:26:54.159 --> 00:26:55.389
“Where’s my wife?”

00:26:55.389 --> 00:26:56.600
I asked.

00:26:56.600 --> 00:26:57.779
But he was already gone.

00:26:57.779 --> 00:27:02.269
That’s when the bottle girl came through
one more time, with another card in hand and

00:27:02.269 --> 00:27:04.450
told me that there’s been a change.

00:27:04.450 --> 00:27:09.370
I turned around and looked through the window
into the game room, and what I saw was more

00:27:09.370 --> 00:27:14.440
upsetting and disturbing than anything else
I had laid eyes on that evening.

00:27:14.440 --> 00:27:16.730
Stripped down and shaking with fear...

00:27:16.730 --> 00:27:19.539
Molly joined the lineup of contestants.

00:27:19.539 --> 00:27:21.940
Number Three.

00:27:21.940 --> 00:27:24.330
Isolated Getaway.

00:27:24.330 --> 00:27:29.570
This... isn’t easy for me to talk about.

00:27:29.570 --> 00:27:33.369
If you’ve ever tried to make long-term plans
in a relationship, you’ll probably know

00:27:33.369 --> 00:27:34.739
what it’s like.

00:27:34.739 --> 00:27:39.749
My boyfriend and I had gone out for two years
and decided to plan a relaxing little getaway.

00:27:39.749 --> 00:27:43.960
You never think that this kind of thing will
happen when you’re planning our trip but…

00:27:43.960 --> 00:27:47.169
we ended up splitting up a month and half
before.

00:27:47.169 --> 00:27:51.179
Ideally, I would have waited until after the
vacation to break up with him, but when I

00:27:51.179 --> 00:27:55.650
caught him fooling around with his physical
therapist, I didn’t even wait a day before

00:27:55.650 --> 00:27:56.650
ending it.

00:27:56.650 --> 00:28:01.289
Lucky for me, I still had a suite booked at
the Grand Maritime Beach Resort.

00:28:01.289 --> 00:28:05.499
For whatever reason, even though he did all
the research and booking, the reservation

00:28:05.499 --> 00:28:09.200
was made under both of our names with my email
address!

00:28:09.200 --> 00:28:13.200
I figured it to be a good consolation prize
for the suffering he put through.

00:28:13.200 --> 00:28:17.179
Besides, I wasn’t going to let him ruin
my much needed time off.

00:28:17.179 --> 00:28:18.980
He’d already done enough damage.

00:28:18.980 --> 00:28:22.580
I’d be enjoying this vacation with or without
him.

00:28:22.580 --> 00:28:27.320
It felt amazing to hop off the plane and stuff
my winter jacket in my bag for the rest of

00:28:27.320 --> 00:28:28.320
the week.

00:28:28.320 --> 00:28:31.919
I breezed through the airport, at the end
of which this short chubby guy asked me if

00:28:31.919 --> 00:28:33.399
I need a ride.

00:28:33.399 --> 00:28:37.620
I told him I was looking for the Grand Maritime
shuttle and it turned out that he was the

00:28:37.620 --> 00:28:38.620
driver!

00:28:38.620 --> 00:28:41.809
I guess I lucked out because we didn’t even
have to wait for any other passengers.

00:28:41.809 --> 00:28:44.999
I’d be enjoying that sunshine before I knew
it.

00:28:44.999 --> 00:28:49.249
Once we arrived at the resort, they told me
my room wasn’t quite ready, but they offered

00:28:49.249 --> 00:28:54.139
to take my bags and let me enjoy the pool
and beach while they made the preparations.

00:28:54.139 --> 00:28:56.710
To be honest, that’s exactly what I wanted.

00:28:56.710 --> 00:28:58.919
I could worry about unpacking later.

00:28:58.919 --> 00:29:02.700
I got changed in the bathroom and found myself
a poolside chair.

00:29:02.700 --> 00:29:07.379
The resort was… not at all what I remembered
my ex describing to me.

00:29:07.379 --> 00:29:09.470
First, I expected more people.

00:29:09.470 --> 00:29:11.950
I mean, I was the only one at the pool area.

00:29:11.950 --> 00:29:15.669
It looked like there were some more people
by the beach, but I felt like it should be

00:29:15.669 --> 00:29:17.669
much more busy at this time of year.

00:29:17.669 --> 00:29:21.090
Still, I didn’t mind some isolation and
time to myself.

00:29:21.090 --> 00:29:24.200
It was also kind of a shoddy place.

00:29:24.200 --> 00:29:27.379
I remembered it looking much better in the
photos.

00:29:27.379 --> 00:29:29.840
Leave it to my stupid ex not to do the research...

00:29:29.840 --> 00:29:30.840
Who cares though.

00:29:30.840 --> 00:29:33.770
I was here, catching some sun and not at work.

00:29:33.770 --> 00:29:36.759
A couple of loose pool tiles could not change
that.

00:29:36.759 --> 00:29:39.419
I decided to take a look around the resort
a bit.

00:29:39.419 --> 00:29:41.289
Again, I was pretty unimpressed.

00:29:41.289 --> 00:29:44.279
Actually, it was kind of creepy.

00:29:44.279 --> 00:29:49.499
It felt as though it hadn’t been renovated
since the 70s and there was nobody around.

00:29:49.499 --> 00:29:53.190
It was like exploring the ruins of a forgotten
old resort.

00:29:53.190 --> 00:29:57.580
There was a smaller pool that I came across
was empty and filled with moss.

00:29:57.580 --> 00:30:01.929
The paintings on the walls were cute… or
at least they might have been several years

00:30:01.929 --> 00:30:06.230
ago, but the paint had chipped away so that
the eyes of they tribal figures that were

00:30:06.230 --> 00:30:08.399
depicted just looked like empty voids.

00:30:08.399 --> 00:30:12.990
I felt more like I was in a forbidden temple
than a welcoming beach resort.

00:30:12.990 --> 00:30:17.690
Corroded statues and broken fences were just
a couple more clues as to why this place was

00:30:17.690 --> 00:30:19.029
so empty.

00:30:19.029 --> 00:30:23.369
There was even a boat on the beach that was
turned over in the sand, gutted for parts

00:30:23.369 --> 00:30:25.039
and covered in graffiti.

00:30:25.039 --> 00:30:29.500
Perhaps the strangest part about it was the
tinny little speakers hidden in rocks around

00:30:29.500 --> 00:30:34.080
the resort which were probably the only evidence
that the place was actually operational.

00:30:34.080 --> 00:30:37.980
I decided to just go back to the pool and
tan until my room was ready.

00:30:37.980 --> 00:30:41.980
While I waited, one of the staff came up to
me and asked if I was interested in their

00:30:41.980 --> 00:30:43.279
complimentary massage.

00:30:43.279 --> 00:30:45.299
That sounded good to me.

00:30:45.299 --> 00:30:48.179
I followed him in into the spa building next
to the pool.

00:30:48.179 --> 00:30:53.080
I laid out face down on the massage table
and he began to go to work on my shoulders.

00:30:53.080 --> 00:30:55.220
It was… oddly quiet.

00:30:55.220 --> 00:30:57.140
No music or anything.

00:30:57.140 --> 00:30:59.659
Just the sound of him breathing and the kneading
of my flesh.

00:30:59.659 --> 00:31:04.640
It was a bit uncomfortable, but at the same
time it just felt so good so I tried to ignore

00:31:04.640 --> 00:31:05.730
it.

00:31:05.730 --> 00:31:07.529
Then it got more uncomfortable.

00:31:07.529 --> 00:31:11.820
The guy just presumptuously unhooks my bikini
and goes to work on that part of my back and

00:31:11.820 --> 00:31:12.940
sides.

00:31:12.940 --> 00:31:16.759
I don’t usually get a lot of massages, but
shouldn’t he ask first before doing something

00:31:16.759 --> 00:31:18.179
like that?

00:31:18.179 --> 00:31:22.820
Then I remembered why I was here and I thought
I should just let myself live a little.

00:31:22.820 --> 00:31:27.759
Someone else came into the room and started
talking to the masseuse in a language I couldn’t

00:31:27.759 --> 00:31:28.759
understand.

00:31:28.759 --> 00:31:32.770
It sounded like he was answering a bunch of
questions, and he sounded kind of angry.

00:31:32.770 --> 00:31:35.450
His voice got louder as he came into the room.

00:31:35.450 --> 00:31:39.980
It sounded like he was right next to my head,
so I opened my eyes and this guy was right

00:31:39.980 --> 00:31:41.769
there staring at me!

00:31:41.769 --> 00:31:44.720
I panicked, but I didn’t quite know what
to do.

00:31:44.720 --> 00:31:46.500
He started pacing around the table.

00:31:46.500 --> 00:31:47.500
Talking to the guy.

00:31:47.500 --> 00:31:50.159
It felt like his eyes were locked onto me.

00:31:50.159 --> 00:31:55.169
My relaxation level dropped fast and my nervousness
level was skyrocketing.

00:31:55.169 --> 00:31:56.669
This guy was unbelievable.

00:31:56.669 --> 00:32:00.109
But then, he actually grabbed my butt!

00:32:00.109 --> 00:32:01.619
I screamed out, “Hey!”

00:32:01.619 --> 00:32:04.480
but I couldn’t fully turn away without exposing
myself.

00:32:04.480 --> 00:32:06.779
I was just about ready to be done with this
massage.

00:32:06.779 --> 00:32:10.200
Why wasn’t the masseuse telling this creep
to buzz off?

00:32:10.200 --> 00:32:12.129
The guy didn’t even let go of me when I
yelled at him!

00:32:12.129 --> 00:32:13.129
What the hell?

00:32:13.129 --> 00:32:17.019
They just carried on their conversation, only
raising their voices, so I started kicking

00:32:17.019 --> 00:32:19.880
and thrashing my feet and screaming at them
to stop!

00:32:19.880 --> 00:32:24.759
Only problem was, I could raise all the ruckus
I wanted but we all knew there was probably

00:32:24.759 --> 00:32:26.309
nobody out there to hear me.

00:32:26.309 --> 00:32:30.619
I tried to fight my way out but the masseuse
ended my struggle swiftly when he dug his

00:32:30.619 --> 00:32:32.289
thumbs somewhere into my shoulders as hard
as he could.

00:32:32.289 --> 00:32:37.139
He must have hit some kind of pressure point
or something because that’s the last thing

00:32:37.139 --> 00:32:38.169
I remembered.

00:32:38.169 --> 00:32:40.730
I was out.

00:32:40.730 --> 00:32:41.730
I woke up.

00:32:41.730 --> 00:32:46.989
By the time I remembered what had happened,
I realized I was in a far worse situation.

00:32:46.989 --> 00:32:52.190
I was on a speedboat zipping through the ocean,
accompanied by only that strange man who had

00:32:52.190 --> 00:32:53.190
violated me.

00:32:53.190 --> 00:32:56.399
I could see the island off in the distance
and it was only getting further and further

00:32:56.399 --> 00:32:57.399
away.

00:32:57.399 --> 00:33:00.539
I jumped out of the boat and swam as fast
as I possibly could!

00:33:00.539 --> 00:33:05.549
I heard the engine die and the driver turn
around as soon as he realized I was gone.

00:33:05.549 --> 00:33:08.130
Before I knew it, the boat was back in front
of me.

00:33:08.130 --> 00:33:12.390
He told me it was stupid to try to swim back
and that it was further than it looked and

00:33:12.390 --> 00:33:14.230
yanked me back in.

00:33:14.230 --> 00:33:15.230
He was right.

00:33:15.230 --> 00:33:18.370
I didn’t have the stamina to swim all the
back to shore.

00:33:18.370 --> 00:33:23.289
As I stared off at how far it really was,
I saw a resort on the coast that looked far

00:33:23.289 --> 00:33:24.590
nicer than my own.

00:33:24.590 --> 00:33:28.679
Why couldn’t my stupid ex have just done
his research and booked a decent place?

00:33:28.679 --> 00:33:31.559
That’s when I realized something…

00:33:31.559 --> 00:33:35.470
The sign displayed above the resort could
just barely be read in the distance…

00:33:35.470 --> 00:33:43.070
It said: Grand Maritime Beach Resort.

00:33:43.070 --> 00:33:44.360
Number Four.

00:33:44.360 --> 00:33:48.350
Last Resort.

00:33:48.350 --> 00:33:51.250
I looked up and saw a ship departing from
the dock.

00:33:51.250 --> 00:33:56.299
A couple of jetski riders zoomed by the ship’s
wake, even managing to catch a little air.

00:33:56.299 --> 00:33:57.299
That looked fun.

00:33:57.299 --> 00:33:59.220
Maybe I could do a little bit of that later.

00:33:59.220 --> 00:34:03.190
I dug my toes into the warm sand and looked
at my watch.

00:34:03.190 --> 00:34:04.200
It was 2:03.

00:34:04.200 --> 00:34:07.309
It seemed like as good a time as any to grab
myself a drink.

00:34:07.309 --> 00:34:12.649
Afterall, the bar here at the Grand Maritime
was complimentary, so why not?

00:34:12.649 --> 00:34:13.649
"Lucy.

00:34:13.649 --> 00:34:14.649
Lucy, you OK?"

00:34:14.649 --> 00:34:18.640
I shook my sleeping girlfriend’s shoulder
lightly to see if she wanted anything.

00:34:18.640 --> 00:34:21.920
"Uhh yeah, I just fell asleep.

00:34:21.920 --> 00:34:23.120
What time is it?"

00:34:23.120 --> 00:34:24.490
"About 2.

00:34:24.490 --> 00:34:25.610
You were tired.

00:34:25.610 --> 00:34:27.160
You look dead."

00:34:27.160 --> 00:34:28.160
"Thanks..."

00:34:28.160 --> 00:34:29.390
"I was just going up to the bar.

00:34:29.390 --> 00:34:30.390
Do you want anything to drink?"

00:34:30.390 --> 00:34:34.040
"You could grab me a Piña Colada I guess."

00:34:34.040 --> 00:34:35.040
"OK."

00:34:35.040 --> 00:34:37.590
With that, I kissed her and headed off to
the bar.

00:34:37.590 --> 00:34:41.290
When I got back with the drinks, my girlfriend
seemed to have wandered off, so I resumed

00:34:41.290 --> 00:34:45.740
my position on the lounge chair and stared
at the shoreline for a bit, full of hope that

00:34:45.740 --> 00:34:49.679
this was going to be the best vacation ever.

00:34:49.679 --> 00:34:50.860
This was so nice.

00:34:50.860 --> 00:34:52.880
About 15 minutes went by.

00:34:52.880 --> 00:34:54.530
Lucy still didn’t show up.

00:34:54.530 --> 00:34:56.090
Ten minutes more.

00:34:56.090 --> 00:34:57.140
Another 15 minutes.

00:34:57.140 --> 00:34:59.730
Where had she run off to?

00:34:59.730 --> 00:35:02.320
There was this old German couple at the chairs
behind us.

00:35:02.320 --> 00:35:06.370
I asked if they’d seen a blond girl in a
black bikini sitting here, and where she might

00:35:06.370 --> 00:35:07.370
have headed off to.

00:35:07.370 --> 00:35:11.250
They said they had seen her talking to “the
survey guy”.

00:35:11.250 --> 00:35:14.780
When I asked who the survey guy was, they
told me he was going around from chair to

00:35:14.780 --> 00:35:18.770
chair with a clipboard asking people if they’d
like to fill out a 15-minute satisfaction

00:35:18.770 --> 00:35:21.690
survey and that they’d seen him talking
to Lucy.

00:35:21.690 --> 00:35:25.600
I asked what direction they’d gone, but
neither one of them was sure.

00:35:25.600 --> 00:35:27.480
I immediately knew something wrong.

00:35:27.480 --> 00:35:32.290
Lucy was not the type to spend 15 minutes
filling out a survey, especially on vacation.

00:35:32.290 --> 00:35:37.050
The next closest person was an attractive
young girl sipping on a smoothie by herself.

00:35:37.050 --> 00:35:41.530
I asked her if she might have seen my girlfriend,
possibly with a guy holding a clipboard?

00:35:41.530 --> 00:35:46.220
She told me she wasn’t sure about Lucy,
but that she may have seen the clipboard guy.

00:35:46.220 --> 00:35:49.930
According to her, he had been going from chair
to chair and had asked her if she wanted to

00:35:49.930 --> 00:35:54.950
sign up for some kind of ‘island adventure’
thing, but she had politely declined.

00:35:54.950 --> 00:35:58.270
Apparently he was really pushing it but she
just wasn’t interested.

00:35:58.270 --> 00:35:59.270
“Excuse me.”

00:35:59.270 --> 00:36:03.350
We were interrupted by a guy who was about
my age, wearing long swim trunks.

00:36:03.350 --> 00:36:06.230
“My apologies for interrupting.

00:36:06.230 --> 00:36:10.270
I just happened to overhear you say you were
looking for your girlfriend.

00:36:10.270 --> 00:36:14.310
My wife seems to have disappeared off this
beach earlier this morning when I ran back

00:36:14.310 --> 00:36:16.040
to the room to get some sunscreen.

00:36:16.040 --> 00:36:19.540
I’ve been looking all over and haven’t
been able to find her.”

00:36:19.540 --> 00:36:22.260
“Yeah, I just went to bar and came back.

00:36:22.260 --> 00:36:25.820
She was gone, it’s been almost and hour
so I started asking around.”

00:36:25.820 --> 00:36:28.510
“Why don’t we both investigate.

00:36:28.510 --> 00:36:31.931
Knowing my wife there’s probably some spa
we don’t know about that they’ve both

00:36:31.931 --> 00:36:32.931
run off to.”

00:36:32.931 --> 00:36:33.931
“Yeah, you’re probably right.

00:36:33.931 --> 00:36:35.660
Let’s go find them.”

00:36:35.660 --> 00:36:38.890
The girl I was talking to said the guy with
the clipboard was headed down the beach to

00:36:38.890 --> 00:36:41.260
the left so we continued that way.

00:36:41.260 --> 00:36:43.480
“My name’s Mike by the way.”

00:36:43.480 --> 00:36:44.480
“Gary.”

00:36:44.480 --> 00:36:46.090
We continued asking around.

00:36:46.090 --> 00:36:50.950
One guy said that he’d seen the survey guy
come by but had told him he wasn’t interested.

00:36:50.950 --> 00:36:52.960
Another couple said they hadn’t seen either
of them.

00:36:52.960 --> 00:36:56.920
And then one chick said that some guy had
asked her to come down to the activity shack

00:36:56.920 --> 00:37:00.840
to sign up for some kind of rainforest adventure
and she’d said no.

00:37:00.840 --> 00:37:04.080
That’s when I remembered Lucy and I checking
into the hotel.

00:37:04.080 --> 00:37:06.970
She found this pamphlet with all these activities.

00:37:06.970 --> 00:37:10.980
I think she told me she was interested in
doing some rainforest hike or something.

00:37:10.980 --> 00:37:13.560
Mike and I decided to look for this activity
shack.

00:37:13.560 --> 00:37:16.110
We headed down the beach to the end of the
resort’s property.

00:37:16.110 --> 00:37:18.720
“Well Mike, I guess this is where we turn
back.”

00:37:18.720 --> 00:37:23.040
“I say we continue searching down the beach
for this supposed activity shack.

00:37:23.040 --> 00:37:26.290
I’ve already searched every inch of the
resort for my wife.

00:37:26.290 --> 00:37:29.310
I’m convinced they’re off the property
somewhere.”

00:37:29.310 --> 00:37:31.470
“I guess I’ll walk down a bit further
with you.

00:37:31.470 --> 00:37:33.600
I’ve got nothing to lose by checking.”

00:37:33.600 --> 00:37:36.610
We continued down the beach until we found
an empty shack.

00:37:36.610 --> 00:37:40.760
It didn’t look like an activity shack per
say, just more of a little hut.

00:37:40.760 --> 00:37:42.950
Before moving on, Mike noticed something in
the sand.

00:37:42.950 --> 00:37:45.960
He pulled up and dusted off a clipboard.

00:37:45.960 --> 00:37:51.140
There was one page on it, an empty spreadsheet
with the words “resort survey” crudely

00:37:51.140 --> 00:37:52.620
printed at the top.

00:37:52.620 --> 00:37:54.150
We looked at each other.

00:37:54.150 --> 00:37:55.150
Mike was wide-eyed.

00:37:55.150 --> 00:37:59.180
He flipped over the paper, and the back was
completely different, a colored advertisement

00:37:59.180 --> 00:38:03.890
with bright graphics of ziplining, a campfire
and a waterfall.

00:38:03.890 --> 00:38:05.260
Something here didn’t add up.

00:38:05.260 --> 00:38:09.900
I only saw two pairs of footsteps in the sand
heading out of the activity shack.

00:38:09.900 --> 00:38:14.660
Instead of leading back to the resort, they
led back inland towards a street.

00:38:14.660 --> 00:38:17.000
Something was not right here.

00:38:17.000 --> 00:38:20.780
Mike and I headed to the street where some
sand was kicked up onto the pavement.

00:38:20.780 --> 00:38:24.560
Someone had definitely J-walked right here,
so we headed across the street and into a

00:38:24.560 --> 00:38:25.560
rainforest.

00:38:25.560 --> 00:38:29.060
We decided to spread out a bit and cover as
much ground as possible.

00:38:29.060 --> 00:38:33.200
We made sure to stay within an earshot of
each other, so when we inevitably got lost,

00:38:33.200 --> 00:38:36.660
at least we weren’t separated from each
other.

00:38:36.660 --> 00:38:38.750
“Lucy!

00:38:38.750 --> 00:38:40.850
Lucy!”

00:38:40.850 --> 00:38:43.820
It seemed like we were totally alone in this
forest.

00:38:43.820 --> 00:38:45.390
It seemed useless.

00:38:45.390 --> 00:38:47.490
I was about ready to turn and go back.

00:38:47.490 --> 00:38:48.680
They couldn’t be out here…

00:38:48.680 --> 00:38:50.760
But that’s when I heard Mike call out to
me.

00:38:50.760 --> 00:38:51.760
“Gary!

00:38:51.760 --> 00:38:52.760
Over here!

00:38:52.760 --> 00:38:53.760
Come quick!”

00:38:53.760 --> 00:38:54.860
My heart jolted and I ran over to him.

00:38:54.860 --> 00:38:59.130
“I was looking around over here and I saw
something way off in the distance.

00:38:59.130 --> 00:39:00.960
There were three figures standing there.

00:39:00.960 --> 00:39:02.140
Two men and a woman.

00:39:02.140 --> 00:39:11.060
I was about to call out to them when the two
men jumped the lady and knocked her out!”

00:39:11.060 --> 00:39:16.790
I felt a sharp pain of nervousness and excitement
in my chest.

00:39:16.790 --> 00:39:17.900
Could it have been Lucy?

00:39:17.900 --> 00:39:21.600
I wanted to be close to finding her but I
couldn’t stand the idea of her not being

00:39:21.600 --> 00:39:22.600
OK.

00:39:22.600 --> 00:39:23.600
“When they noticed me staring they carried
her into a car and sped off.

00:39:23.600 --> 00:39:24.600
I think it could have been your girlfriend.”

00:39:24.600 --> 00:39:25.600
We ran over there.

00:39:25.600 --> 00:39:27.160
There was no real evidence to speak of, but
there were tire tracks that we could follow.

00:39:27.160 --> 00:39:30.970
Not only was it our best bet of finding our
women, but it was probably our only bet for

00:39:30.970 --> 00:39:32.390
finding our way out of here.

00:39:32.390 --> 00:39:35.920
We ended up following these tracks for 3 full
hours.

00:39:35.920 --> 00:39:39.470
It was getting dark by the time we came across
a little campsite.

00:39:39.470 --> 00:39:43.010
There was a bonfire that had recently been
put out, the wood was still charred and I

00:39:43.010 --> 00:39:44.050
could smell smoke.

00:39:44.050 --> 00:39:48.150
The tracks continued on from there though
and 30 minutes later we were finally led out

00:39:48.150 --> 00:39:51.220
of the forest where the tiremarks continued
on sand.

00:39:51.220 --> 00:39:54.670
It was a private little beach area hidden
by rocks on both sides.

00:39:54.670 --> 00:39:58.560
We eventually reached the end of the tracks,
where a Jeep was parked in the sand near the

00:39:58.560 --> 00:40:02.410
water and some footsteps led right into to
the ocean itself.

00:40:02.410 --> 00:40:03.410
Shoot.

00:40:03.410 --> 00:40:05.350
We wouldn’t be able to track them though
the water.

00:40:05.350 --> 00:40:08.150
And there were so many different ways they
could have gone.

00:40:08.150 --> 00:40:11.910
My heart ached as the hope inside of me began
to die.

00:40:11.910 --> 00:40:16.670
I stared into the same crystal blue waters
that I had just hours before, but now with

00:40:16.670 --> 00:40:18.340
an outlook of despair.

00:40:18.340 --> 00:40:20.670
I felt like I was never going to see her again.

00:40:20.670 --> 00:40:23.880
I looked over to Mike.

00:40:23.880 --> 00:40:26.440
“I have an idea.”

00:40:26.440 --> 00:40:30.400
I’d never ridden a jetski before but I was
going to have to learn quick.

00:40:30.400 --> 00:40:34.760
It was easy enough to get the hang of and
I soon found myself focusing more on looking

00:40:34.760 --> 00:40:37.351
for that boat than worrying about the controls.

00:40:37.351 --> 00:40:39.730
We were back in front of the Grand Maritime
resort now.

00:40:39.730 --> 00:40:42.510
There was a little speedboat whipping across
the current in the distance.

00:40:42.510 --> 00:40:45.530
A woman sat up and jumped off of the boat!

00:40:45.530 --> 00:40:48.160
She was thrashing in the water, swimming back
toward the coast.

00:40:48.160 --> 00:40:51.020
The driver of the boat turned back and pulled
her back in.

00:40:51.020 --> 00:40:52.290
“Did you see that?”

00:40:52.290 --> 00:40:53.290
“Yeah.

00:40:53.290 --> 00:40:54.290
That was weird.

00:40:54.290 --> 00:40:56.280
Let’s keep an eye on them.”

00:40:56.280 --> 00:41:00.230
So we did our best to follow this boat, making
sure not to get too close or follow him too

00:41:00.230 --> 00:41:01.500
directly at any point.

00:41:01.500 --> 00:41:05.620
We zig-zagged our way around, just staying
barely within an eyeshot.

00:41:05.620 --> 00:41:10.060
Eventually the boat pulled in next to a much
larger ship which was anchored out at sea.

00:41:10.060 --> 00:41:14.500
The guy tied a rope tethering him to the larger
ship, then climbed aboard dragging the woman

00:41:14.500 --> 00:41:15.500
with him.

00:41:15.500 --> 00:41:17.770
“You park yours up next to that speedboat.

00:41:17.770 --> 00:41:21.550
I’ll hide mine along the other side of the
ship and swim back around to this side.

00:41:21.550 --> 00:41:25.340
That way if they see yours we have a backup
to escape on.”

00:41:25.340 --> 00:41:27.000
This was it.

00:41:27.000 --> 00:41:30.560
If we didn’t find Lucy here, I was probably
never going to see her again.

00:41:30.560 --> 00:41:33.190
I parked the jetski and climbed onto the boat.

00:41:33.190 --> 00:41:40.270
We headed down a dark metal hallway, trying
to keep our footsteps as quiet as possible.

00:41:40.270 --> 00:41:44.580
As we traveled down, the sound of music thumping
from another room got louder.

00:41:44.580 --> 00:41:47.770
Some kind of party was going on on the other
side of this wall.

00:41:47.770 --> 00:41:51.460
There was a door on the side, or we could
just continue further down the hall into the

00:41:51.460 --> 00:41:52.530
dark.

00:41:52.530 --> 00:41:56.890
I decided to peak inside of the door and opened
it juuussstttt a crack.

00:41:56.890 --> 00:41:59.280
It was a huge room.

00:41:59.280 --> 00:42:01.280
Dark, with vibrant neon lights.

00:42:01.280 --> 00:42:04.660
Tons of people dressed up sat at slot machines
and blackjack tables.

00:42:04.660 --> 00:42:08.250
I quickly and quietly closed the door, hoping
I hadn’t been noticed.

00:42:08.250 --> 00:42:12.000
I nodded my head at Mike to continue further
down the corridor, which we couldn’t see

00:42:12.000 --> 00:42:14.110
the end of because of the dark.

00:42:14.110 --> 00:42:16.400
Mike put his hand out in front of me to stop.

00:42:16.400 --> 00:42:20.140
He motioned to his ear, and I listened…

00:42:20.140 --> 00:42:26.990
I could hear breathing at the end of the hallway.

00:42:26.990 --> 00:42:30.830
There was no doubt that someone was standing
guard.

00:42:30.830 --> 00:42:34.810
We knew he was there and he knew we were here.

00:42:34.810 --> 00:42:40.050
Then, as if to break to break the silence
and tension, his voice called out of the dark,

00:42:40.050 --> 00:42:43.710
and told us we weren't allowed back here,
and to head back out to the casino.

00:42:43.710 --> 00:42:47.840
Mike whispered for me to keep quiet, then
spoke out to the guy.

00:42:47.840 --> 00:42:51.830
“Excuse me sir, I was just looking for my
wife.

00:42:51.830 --> 00:42:55.340
I believe she may have wandered back this
way.”

00:42:55.340 --> 00:42:59.630
The guard told him that nobody had been through
this way, but Mike insisted he double check.

00:42:59.630 --> 00:43:03.720
We heard the door he was guarding creak open
and Mike dragged me forward into the dark,

00:43:03.720 --> 00:43:05.210
to where we could see the end of the hall.

00:43:05.210 --> 00:43:09.570
He yanked on the door but it had automatically
locked, so he hid in the corner behind the

00:43:09.570 --> 00:43:10.570
door.

00:43:10.570 --> 00:43:13.800
[whispered] “Stand over there and wait for
him to come through.”

00:43:13.800 --> 00:43:15.620
I could see where Mike was going with this.

00:43:15.620 --> 00:43:19.230
I wasn’t convinced it would work but I couldn't
come up with much better.

00:43:19.230 --> 00:43:21.830
The guard came back through the door and saw
me standing there in the hall.

00:43:21.830 --> 00:43:23.010
I said nothing.

00:43:23.010 --> 00:43:25.640
He told me that nobody had gotten back there.

00:43:25.640 --> 00:43:27.280
“Thanks anyways.”

00:43:27.280 --> 00:43:31.030
The voice came from behind him as Mike jumped
on the guy's back, taking him by surprise

00:43:31.030 --> 00:43:33.010
before he had a chance to close the door behind
him!

00:43:33.010 --> 00:43:34.580
I bolted through the door and made it!

00:43:34.580 --> 00:43:38.320
It slammed shut with a huge metallic clang.

00:43:38.320 --> 00:43:40.930
I would be on my own from here on out.

00:43:40.930 --> 00:43:43.910
The room I found myself in was some kind of
lab.

00:43:43.910 --> 00:43:48.350
There was a row of several operation tables,
and these vertical tubes with a blue glow

00:43:48.350 --> 00:43:49.600
emanating from them.

00:43:49.600 --> 00:43:53.570
I inspected the first one, and it seemed to
just be an empty water tank, though it did

00:43:53.570 --> 00:43:57.540
contain what looked kind of like a scuba regulator
at the end of a tube.

00:43:57.540 --> 00:44:01.320
Before I could inspect any further I heard
a door being unlocked and I quickly dove behind

00:44:01.320 --> 00:44:02.320
the tank to hide.

00:44:02.320 --> 00:44:05.840
“We had no idea what we were getting ourselves
into.

00:44:05.840 --> 00:44:06.960
Please.

00:44:06.960 --> 00:44:12.870
I just want to get my husband and go back
to my hotel.

00:44:12.870 --> 00:44:13.870
Hey, what do you think you're doing?

00:44:13.870 --> 00:44:14.870
Get your hands off me!

00:44:14.870 --> 00:44:15.870
HELP!”

00:44:15.870 --> 00:44:16.870
Two men, who looked to be employees of the
casino, slammed this woman to the operating

00:44:16.870 --> 00:44:18.350
table with her screaming all the while.

00:44:18.350 --> 00:44:21.870
I couldn't fully see what they were doing
to her from where I was, but I did see the

00:44:21.870 --> 00:44:24.250
man's pants drop at his ankles…

00:44:24.250 --> 00:44:28.160
And based on the screams I'm sure you can
guess the rest...

00:44:28.160 --> 00:44:33.820
It was hard enough to stand by and let this
happen, but I also kept imagining my Lucy

00:44:33.820 --> 00:44:35.170
in the same situation.

00:44:35.170 --> 00:44:37.300
My fists were shaking with rage.

00:44:37.300 --> 00:44:40.490
I was gritting my teeth and I could barely
contain myself.

00:44:40.490 --> 00:44:46.020
Still, I had the advantage of them not knowing
I was here, and if I was going to have any

00:44:46.020 --> 00:44:47.920
chance, I had to keep it that way.

00:44:47.920 --> 00:44:52.310
The girl on the table seemed to just give
up the fight, and the man doing the thrusting

00:44:52.310 --> 00:44:56.720
said “ten to one” then spewed out a bunch
of different numbers as if he was some kind

00:44:56.720 --> 00:44:58.060
of twisted odds maker.

00:44:58.060 --> 00:45:02.380
Then the girl, now stark naked, was pushed
out into another room.

00:45:02.380 --> 00:45:04.890
The second guy followed her out there with
a rifle gun!

00:45:04.890 --> 00:45:05.890
Whoa.

00:45:05.890 --> 00:45:08.440
I was in way over my head.

00:45:08.440 --> 00:45:11.450
I had no way to defend myself against that.

00:45:11.450 --> 00:45:14.900
I had to find Lucy and get out without getting
caught.

00:45:14.900 --> 00:45:18.250
The first guy went into a different door and
it looked like he headed up some stairs.

00:45:18.250 --> 00:45:20.520
I jumped up to investigate the rest of the
lab.

00:45:20.520 --> 00:45:23.640
There were more of these water tanks stretching
down the length of the room.

00:45:23.640 --> 00:45:28.300
What I found was that many of them contained
women, again, completely exposed, breathing

00:45:28.300 --> 00:45:29.400
through tubes.

00:45:29.400 --> 00:45:33.130
I recognised one of them as the lady we'd
seen jump off the speedboat earlier.

00:45:33.130 --> 00:45:35.470
The next girl looked in much worse shape.

00:45:35.470 --> 00:45:39.340
Her skin looked charred and her hair was standing
up in every direction.

00:45:39.340 --> 00:45:42.540
My hope was dwindling, but what happened next…

00:45:42.540 --> 00:45:43.560
I…

00:45:43.560 --> 00:45:46.300
I can't even explain the feeling that shot
through me.

00:45:46.300 --> 00:45:47.920
It was Lucy.

00:45:47.920 --> 00:45:50.560
I nearly blacked out upon seeing her.

00:45:50.560 --> 00:45:54.640
I was feeling every emotion a person can feel
all at once.

00:45:54.640 --> 00:45:59.140
Her eyes were closed and she was just gracefully
floating there, breathing through a mask,

00:45:59.140 --> 00:46:00.160
but definitely breathing.

00:46:00.160 --> 00:46:04.790
I knocked on the glass, unsure of how to get
her out.

00:46:04.790 --> 00:46:05.830
She didn't hear.

00:46:05.830 --> 00:46:06.830
*Knock*

00:46:06.830 --> 00:46:10.440
I knocked harder and her eyes shot open; you
could just see that they were immediately

00:46:10.440 --> 00:46:14.030
filled with fear; that she'd been conditioned
to expect abuse.

00:46:14.030 --> 00:46:16.930
But once she recognized me, everything changed.

00:46:16.930 --> 00:46:20.230
She put her hand up to the glass and I reached
up and did the same.

00:46:20.230 --> 00:46:23.100
Once again, I heard the door unlock and I
ducked into hiding.

00:46:23.100 --> 00:46:25.210
This time it was two men.

00:46:25.210 --> 00:46:28.320
One looked like he was native to the island,
the other was a foreigner.

00:46:28.320 --> 00:46:29.520
Both were wearing suits.

00:46:29.520 --> 00:46:31.580
The foreign guy had a drink in his hand.

00:46:31.580 --> 00:46:34.580
He was overweight and and seemed to have a
breathing problem.

00:46:34.580 --> 00:46:38.810
There was a metal tube coming out of his neck
that seemed to be regulating his respiratory

00:46:38.810 --> 00:46:39.810
system.

00:46:39.810 --> 00:46:46.470
“That really was quite a show you put on
there, I must say.

00:46:46.470 --> 00:46:55.210
I do understand the relevance, of games 2
and 3, when making such decisions, but what

00:46:55.210 --> 00:46:57.390
was the point of the first game?”

00:46:57.390 --> 00:47:01.180
The islander guy responded, “simply to break
them.”

00:47:01.180 --> 00:47:02.380
“I see.

00:47:02.380 --> 00:47:04.780
This one performed beautifully.

00:47:04.780 --> 00:47:07.080
A fine specimen indeed.

00:47:07.080 --> 00:47:13.730
No doubt I'll be willing to shell out for
her.”

00:47:13.730 --> 00:47:16.570
They started talking prices and times.

00:47:16.570 --> 00:47:17.570
That was it.

00:47:17.570 --> 00:47:21.030
I couldn't stand by anymore and watch this
frickin guy whore out my girlfriend.

00:47:21.030 --> 00:47:22.640
I didn't care if I got myself killed.

00:47:22.640 --> 00:47:24.440
I just couldn't sit there and hide anymore.

00:47:24.440 --> 00:47:26.300
I crawled out, the guy didn't see me.

00:47:26.300 --> 00:47:29.590
I got a running start and socked the **** in
the face full speed!

00:47:29.590 --> 00:47:33.020
I shattered my fist but I didn't even realize
it at the time.

00:47:33.020 --> 00:47:36.380
Before he knew what hit him, I grabbed that
fat **** by the back of the neck and thrashed

00:47:36.380 --> 00:47:37.380
his face into the glass.

00:47:37.380 --> 00:47:41.260
It didn't budge, but it must have set off
some kind of alarm and a red light started

00:47:41.260 --> 00:47:42.260
flashing.

00:47:42.260 --> 00:47:47.340
I thrust his face into the glass, 2, 3, 4
times before it started to show a crack, which

00:47:47.340 --> 00:47:51.840
I noticed on the growing splotch of liquid
red now on the surface of the window.

00:47:51.840 --> 00:47:55.820
I reared back one more time, and with all
my might, shattered the tank on this guy's

00:47:55.820 --> 00:47:57.040
skull.

00:47:57.040 --> 00:48:00.390
Water washed out everywhere with a greater
force than I expected.

00:48:00.390 --> 00:48:02.310
Lucy went sliding across the lab floor.

00:48:02.310 --> 00:48:05.780
I helped her get to her feet, but there was
no time for a heartfelt reunion.

00:48:05.780 --> 00:48:07.170
We ran for our lives.

00:48:07.170 --> 00:48:09.870
As we exited I heard the voices of yelling
men behind us.

00:48:09.870 --> 00:48:13.760
We made it to the hall where I had left Mike
and the guard.

00:48:13.760 --> 00:48:16.740
I wasn't sure where the guard had gone, but
it was clear what has happened to Mike, he

00:48:16.740 --> 00:48:19.170
was beaten to a pulp and left sprawled out
on the floor.

00:48:19.170 --> 00:48:20.810
Then was no time to mourn.

00:48:20.810 --> 00:48:23.320
If we were lucky we might just get out alive.

00:48:23.320 --> 00:48:24.850
We made to the hatch.

00:48:24.850 --> 00:48:26.340
Somehow I was able to pry it open.

00:48:26.340 --> 00:48:28.210
We were back into the open air.

00:48:28.210 --> 00:48:29.210
Almost home free!

00:48:29.210 --> 00:48:33.270
But what waited for us on the other side would
possibly be my toughest challenge yet.

00:48:33.270 --> 00:48:37.760
The guard who had beaten Mike was standing
over the jetski I had pulled up in, which

00:48:37.760 --> 00:48:40.800
was on fire, and he continued to pour on the
gasoline.

00:48:40.800 --> 00:48:42.640
He turned around and saw us.

00:48:42.640 --> 00:48:46.260
Not knowing what else to do, I pushed him,
hoping to catch him off balance or something,

00:48:46.260 --> 00:48:47.570
and somehow it worked!

00:48:47.570 --> 00:48:51.350
He went crashing down into the flaming vehicle
before falling into the water.

00:48:51.350 --> 00:48:55.050
I had no idea if he'd gotten to the other
jetski but it was our only hope.

00:48:55.050 --> 00:48:56.050
“This way!”

00:48:56.050 --> 00:48:59.010
I took my girlfriend's hand and jumped out
into the ocean.

00:48:59.010 --> 00:49:00.470
We swam like there was no tomorrow.

00:49:00.470 --> 00:49:04.730
*gasping for air* “Where are we going?”

00:49:04.730 --> 00:49:10.010
The ship billowed it's horn over and over,
and I began to fear it might be a distress

00:49:10.010 --> 00:49:11.010
call.

00:49:11.010 --> 00:49:14.800
Still, if we got to the jetski, there probably
wasn't much they could do to catch us.

00:49:14.800 --> 00:49:15.820
This was it.

00:49:15.820 --> 00:49:17.480
It all came down to the escape.

00:49:17.480 --> 00:49:21.010
We turned the corner around the outside of
the ship to where Mike's jetski should have

00:49:21.010 --> 00:49:22.010
been…

00:49:22.010 --> 00:49:24.190
But it was gone…

00:49:24.190 --> 00:49:26.720
So that's it then.

00:49:26.720 --> 00:49:29.040
It was all for nothing.

00:49:29.040 --> 00:49:30.040
“There!

00:49:30.040 --> 00:49:31.450
What's that over there?”

00:49:31.450 --> 00:49:33.340
Off in the distance was Mike’s jetski!

00:49:33.340 --> 00:49:35.230
It had just drifted away from the ship!

00:49:35.230 --> 00:49:41.440
It was a long swim but we made it!

00:49:41.440 --> 00:49:44.470
The rest of the night was mostly a blur.

00:49:44.470 --> 00:49:49.230
I don't remember much of when we crashed into
the shore terrifying the tourists who were

00:49:49.230 --> 00:49:51.870
enjoying the ocean in moonlight.

00:49:51.870 --> 00:49:57.500
I don't remember the trip to the emergency
room, but I do remember when the pain of what

00:49:57.500 --> 00:50:01.070
they had done to me finally set in.

00:50:01.070 --> 00:50:05.670
The police came to talk to us, as did some
representatives from the resort.

00:50:05.670 --> 00:50:12.020
The casino was in international waters, so
it was out of the jurisdiction of the law.

00:50:12.020 --> 00:50:17.160
But they told us they were doing everything
they could to stop abductions on the land

00:50:17.160 --> 00:50:21.720
and keep tourists informed on the dangers
of gambling offshore.

00:50:21.720 --> 00:50:27.620
They had warnings posted all over the island,
but that didn't stop people from being drawn

00:50:27.620 --> 00:50:32.780
to the thrill and they would find other ways
to lure people in.

00:50:32.780 --> 00:50:38.620
The resort wasn't involved in any of this,
but of course they told us they would be striving

00:50:38.620 --> 00:50:44.390
to improve their security on the beach and
make sure people knew what dangers lie beyond

00:50:44.390 --> 00:50:45.450
their walls.

00:50:45.450 --> 00:50:50.680
They were kind enough to pay our medical bill
and we wouldn't have to worry about paying

00:50:50.680 --> 00:50:52.520
for our stay either.

00:50:52.520 --> 00:50:59.290
They even offered a free week at the resort
at a time of our choosing, but I already knew

00:50:59.290 --> 00:51:03.930
we would NEVER be coming back.

00:51:03.930 --> 00:51:07.140
The pain of my broken hand was really starting
to set in.

00:51:07.140 --> 00:51:12.030
The police wanted to know more about Mike
and his wife, but we didn't have much information

00:51:12.030 --> 00:51:15.510
to help them, other than the fact that his
wife was still out there.

00:51:15.510 --> 00:51:19.090
I asked if trafficking had always been a problem
on this island.

00:51:19.090 --> 00:51:24.160
His response made everything that had happened
to us that night seem even scarier.

00:51:24.160 --> 00:51:29.500
He scoffed at me and said, “if only it was
just trafficking…”

00:51:29.500 --> 00:51:36.220
Thanks for listening to Al Dente Creepypasta.

00:51:36.220 --> 00:51:41.550
Your total today comes out to $4,000 but if
you like this video right now I’ll waive

00:51:41.550 --> 00:51:46.530
