If you like Al Dente Creepypasta I’d recommend
each of their channels and I’ll leave links

00:52:00.090 --> 00:52:03.270
to their work in the description, please take
the time to visit their channels.

00:52:03.270 --> 00:52:07.230
Also I’d like to give thanks to Cole Grey
for voicing the foreign buyer, he’s actually

00:52:07.230 --> 00:52:10.330
a comedy channel and he’s got great stuff,
you’ve got to go check him out.

00:52:10.330 --> 00:52:15.270
As always, thank OST Maker for putting together
